@Drive in the shadow @myeaw_myeaw 

From my perspective, if a trainer is willing to use their own gear for farming or training, then there really shouldn’t be much to worry about. It wouldn’t make sense for them to waste time ripping your EXP when their main focus and priority is to earn kks.

That said, this situation seems more like a suspicion rather than a confirmed issue. Whenever you hire someone to farm or train your account, trust is the most important factor. If you feel uncertain or have doubts, it’s always safer to avoid hiring in the first place rather than taking the risk.
